# The repo-root .gitignore excludes `**/build/` as a build-output convention.
# `frontend/build/` is the opposite: it is electron-builder's `buildResources`
# INPUT directory, holding committed source artwork (icon-macos.svg) and the
# committed offline-generated app icon (icon.icns). Re-include it here.
!/build/
# ...but `scripts/generate-macos-icon.mjs --keep-iconset` materialises an
# intermediate iconset there. That is regenerable rasteriser output, not source.
/build/icon.iconset/

